    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">TROPOSPHERIC/MID-LEVEL CLOUDS (OBSERVED/ANALYZED)</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-10-09 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Mid-level clouds that form in the middle of the troposphere, the lowest part of the Earth&apos;s atmosphere. The clouds are made up of water droplets, ice crystals, or a combination of both, depending on the temperature and altitude.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
