    <skos:changeNote>Date=2017-04-21 User Id=sritz Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Water vapor is defined as water substance in vapor form; one of the
most important of all constituents of the atmosphere. In meteorology,
a profile is defined as a graph of the value of a scalar quantity versus a
horizontal, vertical, or time scale. It usually refers to
a vertical representation.
New Value=In meteorology, a profile is defined as a graph of the value of a scalar quantity versus a horizontal, vertical, or time scale. It usually refers to a vertical representation.</skos:changeNote>
