    <skos:narrower rdf:resource="f141c968-94d4-4c42-8877-bbe34bb84b26"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A linkage between weather changes occuring in widely seperated regions of theglobe.
The term &apos;teleconnections&apos; is most commonly applied to variability on monthlyor longer timescales and refers to the fact that such correlations suggest thatinformation is propagating between distant points through the atmosphere.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:modified>2013-03-13 16:27:15.0</dcterms:modified>
