    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">LUMINESCENCE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-03-13 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: It is the emission of “cold light” from minerals. There are several varieties of luminescence, each named according to the source of energy, or the trigger for the luminescence.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-03-07 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=LUMINESCENCE [b727b561-f738-436d-bb96-137b455bb54a,83135] - METALS PHYSICAL/OPTICAL PROPERTIES [85d46af8-f6ce-490d-a971-0f03b301c1e4,83117]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Fluorescent Mineral Society" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">It is the emission of “cold light” from minerals. There are several varieties of luminescence, each named according to the source of energy, or the trigger for the luminescence.</skos:definition>
