System Note=add broader relation
New Value=CROP HEIGHT [e95bcfcd-a7b6-4317-a678-fe713405f1c8,559599] - PLANT CHARACTERISTICS [0408bac9-c247-4b00-80de-f4665b813658,84873]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="NASA NSIDC, https://nsidc.org/" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Crop Height is defined as the height above the soil (measured in cm) for individual plants.</skos:definition>
