    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The total atmospheric water vapor contained in a vertical column ofunit cross-sectional area (in a cloud) extending between any two specifiedlevels, commonly expressed in terms of the height to which that watersubstance would stand if completely condensed and collected in a vessel ofthe same unit cross section.</skos:definition>
