    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">SALT MARSH</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-08-20 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: An environment in the upper coastal intertidal zone between land and salty or brackish water, dominated by dense stands of halophytic  (salt-tolerant) plants such as herbs, grasses, or low shrubs.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
