    <skos:changeNote>Date=2016-06-15 User Id=gee-cee Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Areas with vegetation dominated by shrubs (generally greater than 0.5 m or
1.5 ft tall, but less than 5 m or 16 ft tall) with individuals or
clumps overlapping to not touching (generally forming more  than 25%
