    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-08-23 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=The science dealing with the form and surface configuration of the solid earth.
It is primarily an attempt to reveal the complex interrelationships between the
origin (and therefore material composition) of surface features on the one
hand, and the causes of the surface alteration (erosion, weather, crustal
upheaval, etc.) on the other hand.
