    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">DATA REFORMATTING</skos:prefLabel>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="IEEE Standard Computer Dictionary" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Reformatting services are defined as Data Handling Services that allow for the alteration of the structure of an Earth science data set so as to make the data set accessible for use by a product or service for which it was not originally compatible. EXAMPLES: Binary to ASCII, HDF to CDF.</skos:definition>
