System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Macrofossils are fossils large enough to be studied without the aid of a
microscope. Macrofossils can indicate the range of plant or animal species in
the past.
New Value=Macrofossils are fossils large enough to be studied without the aid of a
microscope. Macrofossils can indicate the range of plant or animal species in
the past.</skos:changeNote>
