    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">EXTRATROPICAL CYCLONES</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2016-06-28 User Id=saritz Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: (Sometimes called extratropical low, extratropical storm.) Any cyclonic-scale storm that is not a tropical cyclone, usually referring only to the migratory frontal cyclones of middle and high latitudes.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
