User Note=Move Concepts
System Note=delete broader relation
Old Value=SURFACE MOISTURE INDEX [c7503ec5-4e63-446a-9390-72c8a638a0af,23065] - DROUGHT/PRECIPITATION INDICES [5b42e474-2917-4fa3-852d-8b0f91acf0b3,20047]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Nemani, R.R., L.L.Pierce, and S.W. Running. (1993). Developing satellite-derived estimates of surface moisture status. &lt;i&gt;Journal of Applied Meteorology&lt;/i&gt;,32: 548-557. &apos;http://www.forestry.umt.edu/rsl/smi/smi_overview.htm&apos;" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Surface Moisture Index incorporates remote measures of vegetation
condition coupled with radiometric thermal (temperature) data to
characterize surface moisture conditions. It is mapped using two
primary inputs; vegetation status as depicted by Normalized Difference
Vegetation Index (NDVI) and surface temperature.</skos:definition>
