    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-08-16 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=NarrowerRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add narrower relation
New Value=TECTONIC LANDFORMS [9673dc0b-89c0-4f0c-b378-f1c8cb267c8f,105291] - LAVA DOME [78200b25-8c91-4f1b-82cc-ed79764cd647,105739]</skos:changeNote>
