    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Jackson, Julia A. (1997) &lt;i&gt;Glossary of Geology, 4th Edition&lt;/i&gt;.  Alexandria, VA:American Geological Institute, 769 p. &lt;br&gt; See &apos;http://www.geolab.nrcan.gc.ca/geomag/e_effects.html&apos; for examples." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The magnetic phenomena exhibited by the Earth and it&apos;s atmosphere; also thestudy of such phenomena. &lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt; 
A Geomagnetic Advisory will incorporate information on geomagnetic storms thatmay interfere with some technology, including satellite communications.</skos:definition>
