    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="World Wildlife Fund" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A rolling grassland scattered with shrubs and isolated trees, which can be found between a tropical rainforest and desert biome. Not enough rain falls on a savanna to support forests. Savannas are also known as tropical grasslands</skos:definition>
