    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Curriculum Support Services are defined as Education/Outreach Services that are designed to supplement primary Earth Science and/or Global Environmental Change teaching methods and materials. These materials will either reinforceunderstanding of a previously introduced concept or will introduce a new concept not covered by primary materials.</skos:definition>
