    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-10-16 User Id=saritz Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
User Note=updated definition
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Temperature is defined, in general, as the degree of hotness or coldness
as measured on some definite temperature scale by means of any of various
types of thermometers. In meteorology, a profile is defined as a
graph of the value of a scalar quantity versus a horizontal, vertical, or
time scale.   It usually refers to a vertical representation.
New Value=Temperature is defined, in general, as the degree of hotness or coldness measured on some definite temperature scale by means of any of various types of thermometers;In meteorology, a profile is defined as a
graph of the value of a scalar quantity versus a horizontal, vertical, or time scale.   It usually refers to a vertical representation.</skos:changeNote>
