    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Temperature is defined, in general, as the degree of hotness or coldness measured on some definite temperature scale by means of any of various types of thermometers;In meteorology, a profile is defined as agraph of the value of a scalar quantity versus a horizontal, vertical, or time scale.   It usually refers to a vertical representation.</skos:definition>
