    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">GENOTYPING</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-03-01 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Genotyping is the process of determining differences in the genetic make-up (genotype) of an individual by examining the individual’s DNA sequence using biological assays and comparing it with another individual’s sequence or a reference sequence. It identifies the alleles an individual has inherited from their parents.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
