    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">RIPPLES</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-03-22 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Sedimentary structures (i.e. bedforms of the lower flow regime) and indicate agitation by water (current or waves) or wind.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
