User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=RIPPLES [cae41424-161f-4378-a1a4-62cd76c61143,82839] - AEOLIAN LANDFORMS [26637389-f4f6-47a0-9c3d-17e93ab99dea,64129]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="PhysicalGeography.net" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Sedimentary structures (i.e. bedforms of the lower flow regime) and indicate agitation by water (current or waves) or wind.</skos:definition>
