    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ANIMAL HEALTH ADVISORIES</skos:prefLabel>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="World Wildlife Fund - Australia" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A report regarding the current state of wild and domestic animals, excluding humans, physical well-being as it may be affected by certain environmental factors and/or human interaction. An environmental factor may include local, regional, or global climate changes such as drought. Human intervention may include preservation.</skos:definition>
