See also Hall, D.K. and J. Martinec. 1985. &quot;Remote Sensing of Ice and Snow&quot;,
Chapman and Hall, London.
New Value=Canadian Ice Service - Environment Canada 
&quot;http://www.cis.ec.gc.ca/manice/chp1_eng.htm&quot; 
See also Hall, D.K. and J. Martinec. 1985. &quot;Remote Sensing of Ice and Snow&quot;,
Chapman and Hall, London.</skos:changeNote>
