    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Warnings and forecasts which help mariners plan and make decisions protectinglife and property.  Examples of this type of advisory includes informationabout hazardous sea conditions or lower wind speeds that may affect small craftoperations, warnings for storms(ie tropical storms and hurricane warnings) &lt;BR&gt;Example: &lt;a href=&apos;http://205.156.54.206/om/marine2.htm&apos;&gt;
