    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Hydrogen (H) is the lightest and most abundant chemical element. It is onlyfound in trace quantities in the atmosphere.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:modified>2021-02-26 09:24:20.0</dcterms:modified>
