    <skos:changeNote>Date=2017-04-21 User Id=sritz Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Water Vapor convergence/divergence is the derivative of a flux -- which indicates flow into a volume, which has units kg/m^2/s.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
