    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Reports providing information pertaining to the study of frozen seawater overthe ocean surface.&lt;br&gt;
Sea Ice Advisory Services include warnings for ice melting, and daily analysesthrough real time data and forecast.</skos:definition>
