    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">FRESHWATER ECOSYSTEMS</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2016-07-12 User Id=gee-cee Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Subset of Earth&apos;s aquatic ecosystems. They include lakes and ponds, rivers, streams, springs, and wetlands. They can be contrasted with marine ecosystems, which have a larger salt content.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
