    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">LONGITUDINAL/LINEAR DUNE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-08-05 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=LONGITUDINAL/LINEAR DUNE [b5ee3496-6910-4971-8539-5aa084bfa9e1,105431] - DUNES [416221ec-04e1-4913-aacb-9045551949c4,105421]</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-08-16 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Elongate parallel to the prevailing wind, possibly caused by a larger dune having its smaller sides blown away. Seif dunes are sharp-crested and are common in the Sahara. They range up to 300 m (980 ft) in height and 300 km (190 mi) in length.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
