    <skos:changeNote>Date=2018-03-12 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Refers to mechanisms to measure water quality and summarizes and presents water-quality data in an easily understood format.
New Value=Provides a single number (like a grade) that expresses overall water quality at a certain location and time based on several water quality parameters. The objective of an index is to turn complex water quality data into information that is understandable and usable by the public.</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="EPA" xml:lang="en"/>
