    <skos:narrower rdf:resource="a71d195e-ff30-4592-a22c-a82af92f3d1f"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Provides a single number (like a grade) that expresses overall water quality at a certain location and time based on several water quality parameters. The objective of an index is to turn complex water quality data into information that is understandable and usable by the public.</skos:definition>
