    <skos:narrower rdf:resource="e631c681-5dad-48b2-83ce-943a1f0df47a"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A subphylum or superclass of arthropods containing over 35,000 speciesdistributed  worldwide, mainly in freshwater and marine habitats, where theyconstitute a major component of plankton.</skos:definition>
