    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">SALTATION</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-08-05 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=SALTATION [e8ba38ce-fc48-44b7-8b78-03b69e068d46,105369] - FLUVIAL PROCESSES [4b982bef-56fe-41e9-a131-af575a8fec6a,84331]</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-08-15 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: A specific type of particle transport by fluids such as wind, or the denser fluid water. It occurs when loose material is removed from a bed and carried by the fluid, before being transported back to the surface.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="PhysicalGeography.net" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A specific type of particle transport by fluids such as wind, or the denser fluid water. It occurs when loose material is removed from a bed and carried by the fluid, before being transported back to the surface.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:modified>2013-08-15 13:56:21.0</dcterms:modified>
