    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">NORTHEAST BRAZIL RAINFALL ANOMALY</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2012-07-03 User Id=mpmorahan Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: The northeast Brazil rainfall index is calculated from data for Fortaleza (3.7S, 38.5W) and Quixeramobim (5.3S, 39.3W) Brazil obtained from the NCAR World Monthly Surface Station Climatology. Climatological mean is for 1950-79.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
