    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Joint Institute for the Study of the Atmosphere and Ocean (JISAO): http://jisao.washington.edu/data_sets/brazil/" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The northeast Brazil rainfall index is calculated from data for Fortaleza (3.7S, 38.5W) and Quixeramobim (5.3S, 39.3W) Brazil obtained from the NCAR World Monthly Surface Station Climatology. Climatological mean is for 1950-79.</skos:definition>
