    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Australian National University, Research School of Earth Sciences, ANU College of Physical &amp; Mathematical Sciences, Dynamical models of the global ocean overturning circulation, http://rses.anu.edu.au/research/projects/dynamical-models-global-ocean-overturning-circulation" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The oceans overturn, with surface waters sinking to deep in the ocean at high latitudes, drawing warm waters and heat poleward from low latitude.</skos:definition>
