    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-10-11 User Id=saritz Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
User Note=added new definition
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=In thermodynamics, the conversion of kinetic energy into heat by work
done against the viscous stresses in the boundary layer.
New Value=Air temperature measured within the the bottom layer (atmospheric boundary layer) of the troposphere that is in contact with the surface of the earth.</skos:changeNote>
