User Note=Move Concepts
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=BOUNDARY LAYER TEMPERATURE [e9c3b6ca-a534-4f3e-82de-b8b921e8f312,84989] - SURFACE TEMPERATURE [5a7bb095-4d12-4232-bc75-b8e82197cb92,86389]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Derived from Glossary of Meteorology, American Meteorological Society, 2013" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Air temperature measured within the the bottom layer (atmospheric boundary layer) of the troposphere that is in contact with the surface of the earth.</skos:definition>
