    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Sheppard, William Fleetwood (1911). &apos;Interpolation&apos; . In Chisholm, Hugh (ed.). Encyclopædia Britannica. 14 (11th ed.). Cambridge University Press. pp. 706–710." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A type of estimation, a method of constructing new data points within the range of a discrete set of known data points.</skos:definition>
