    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Subclass of class Anthozoa (Phylum Cnidarian) of aquatic organisms formed by colonial polyps with eight fold symmetry, consisting of &apos;soft corals&apos; lacking a distinct stony skeleton distinguished by minute, spiny skeletal sclerites used in identification.</skos:definition>
