text: Phylum Chordata. Class Mammalia. Order Carnivora. Family Canidae. Digitigrade caniform animals with elongated legs, non-retractile claws, with bodies covered in hair except the tip of nose and cushioned pads on feet. Mostly social animals, communicate by scent signal and vocalization
