    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Phylum Chordata. Class Mammalia. Order Carnivora. Otters, Family Mustelidae, are small carnivorous mammals with short legs, round ears, tail tappering to a point, nose with a blunt tip, and guard hair covering insulating coarse fur.</skos:definition>
