University Press, Cambridge, UK. Maunder, W.J. 1994. Dictionary of Global
Climate Change, 2nd ed. Chapman and Hall, NY.
New Value=Houghton, J. 1997. Global Warming: The Complete Briefing, 2nd. ed. Cambridge University Press, Cambridge, UK. Maunder, W.J. 1994. Dictionary of Global Climate Change, 2nd ed. Chapman and Hall, NY.</skos:changeNote>
