    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ICE ROUGHNESS</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-10-02 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=The small-scale variation in the relief of the terrain surface (in this
case the surface of the ice). Remote sensing instruments, such as radar
and microwave sensors, have been able to detect the degree of roughness of
sea, lake, and river ice.
New Value=The small-scale variation in the relief of the terrain surface (in this
case the surface of the ice). Remote sensing instruments, such as radar
and microwave sensors, have been able to detect the degree of roughness of
sea, lake, and river ice.</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-10-02 User Id=tstevens Entity=WeightedRelation Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert WeightedRelation
