System Note=add broader relation
New Value=MONOCULTURE [941c691a-3bff-4c58-854a-16c5529524e9,40097] - AGRICULTURE PRODUCTION [83741fb9-6f86-4670-abbb-c1f3b14a939d,22393]</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2012-06-29 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: The agricultural practice of producing or growing one single crop over a wide area. It is widely used in modern industrial agriculture  and its implementation has allowed for large harvests from minimal labor. However, monocultures can lead to the quicker spread of diseases, where a uniform crop is susceptible to a pathogen.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
