    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">FAST ICE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-08-09 User Id=sritz Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Definition: Ice that is anchored to the shore or ocean bottom, typically over shallow ocean shelves at continental margins. Fast ice does not move with the winds or currents. Also known as landfast ice.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-08-09 User Id=sritz Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
