    <skos:changeNote>Date=2022-07-26 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: A machine learning model type that uses both supervised and unsupervised learning in its approach. Semi-supervised techniques take advantage of both labelled and unlabeled data.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2022-07-25 User Id=tstevens Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=SEMI-SUPERVISED [8b8fd0d4-f70d-4d5a-b4fa-c43bc42ccfe8,996684] - MACHINE LEARNING MODELS [fe4392b0-13a9-43ff-bacc-f44a65aed4fa,996680]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Encyclopedia of Machine Learning and Data Science: https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4899-7502-7" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A machine learning model type that uses both supervised and unsupervised learning in its approach. Semi-supervised techniques take advantage of both labelled and unlabeled data.</skos:definition>
