New Value=SUB-BOTTOM PROFILE [8b22d265-0f46-46c1-b307-1957527c13bb,560137] - BATHYMETRY/SEAFLOOR TOPOGRAPHY [c16bda61-353b-4668-af2f-bbb98785b6fa,84187]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Penrose, J.D., Siwabessy, P.J.W., Gavrilov, A., Parnum, I., Hamilton, L.J., Bickers, A., Brooke, B., Ryan, D.A., Kennedy, P., 2005. Acoustic techniques for seabed classification. Cooperative Research Centre for Coastal Zone Estuary and Waterway Management, Technical Report 32." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Sub-bottom profiles provide three dimensional information about the sea floor and the layers that lie beneath, data which is collected by a sub-bottom profiling system.</skos:definition>
