    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="McGraw-Hill Science &amp; Technology Dictionary" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Erosion resulting from glacial action, whereby the surface material is removed and the rock fragments carried by the glacier abrade, scratch, and polish the bedrock.</skos:definition>
