    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CLASSROOM ACTIVITIES</skos:prefLabel>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="NASA GCMD" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Classroom Activities are defined as Education/Outreach Services that are designed to supplement primary Earth Science and/or Global Environmental Change teaching methods and materials. These materials can be in the forms of a laboratory experiment or a hands-on activity done by students in a classroom.</skos:definition>
