    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">MEAN DYNAMIC TOPOGRAPHY</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2021-10-22 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: The mean dynamic topography (MDT) is the height of the time-mean sea surface above the geoid. Its slope reveals the magnitude and direction of ocean surface geostrophic currents; hence, it is a surface representation of the ocean&apos;s mean circulation.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2021-10-21 User Id=tstevens Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
