    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="National Research Council. 1992. Restoration of Aquatic Ecosystems. National Academy Press." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Wetlands is a term for a broad group of wet habitats. They are transitional lands between terrestrial and aquatic ecosystems where the lands may be permanently or intermittently water covered.</skos:definition>
