    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">OROGENIC MOVEMENT</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-08-16 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: The formation of mountain ranges by intense upward displacement of the earth&apos;s crust, usually associated with folding, thrust faulting, and other compressional processes.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
