    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Phylum Cnidaria. Class Anthozoa. Subclass Octocorallia. Class Pennatulacea. Water-based animals formed by colonial polyps with 8 fold symmetry, consisting of &apos;soft corals&apos; lacking a distinct stony skeleton distinguished by upright stalks, and specialized polyps with specific functions</skos:definition>
