    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">DEFORESTATION</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2012-07-11 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Deforestation is the removal of trees from a locality. This removal may be
either temporary or permanent, leading to partial or complete eradication of
the tree cover. It can be a gradual or rapid process, and may occur by means of
natural or human agencies, or a combination of both.
New Value=Deforestation is the removal of trees from a locality. This removal may be either temporary or permanent, leading to partial or complete eradication of the tree cover. It can be a gradual or rapid process, and may occur by means of natural or human agencies, or a combination of both.</skos:changeNote>
