User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=OXYGEN ISOTOPES [a1362cee-634d-40f4-b47f-901b328895c3,106771] - ISOTOPES [a0358b3e-0926-4b17-8b32-c1b15a73cba5,87287]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="National Snow and Ice Data Center CIRES/University of Colorado" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Naturally occurring oxygen is composed of threestable isotopes, 16O, 17O, and 18O, with 16O being the most abundant (99.762% natural abundance)</skos:definition>
