    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">BASAL ICE FREEZING</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-04-01 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: A process made by made by glaciohydraulic supercooling, though some studies show that even where physical conditions allow it to occur, the process may not be responsible for observed sequences of basal ice.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-03-05 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=BASAL ICE FREEZING [a72c8430-0b33-4167-b189-1309cc2048c5,82791] - FREEZE/THAW [f7849055-fa5c-437c-a8c6-08c7db3a3b0a,82789]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Benn, Douglas I. (1999). Glaciers and Glaciation" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A process made by made by glaciohydraulic supercooling, though some studies show that even where physical conditions allow it to occur, the process may not be responsible for observed sequences of basal ice.</skos:definition>
