    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">NET ECOSYSTEM CO2 EXCHANGE (NEE)</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2020-01-17 User Id=sritz Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=NET ECOSYSTEM CO2 EXCHANGE (NEE) [f6a8db71-9686-46ec-a3ac-66ca4a0ec1bd,559693] - CARBON [a7ae5843-479c-4055-b8fc-ba651e485750,84059]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="National Snow and Ice Data Center, NSIDC, https://nsidc.org/" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">&apos;NEE of CO2&apos; with the atmosphere is a fundamental measure of the balance between carbon uptake by the vegetation &apos;GPP&apos; and carbon losses through &apos;autotrophic&apos; and &apos;heterotrophic respiration&apos;.</skos:definition>
