    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any measure related to the processing of food stuffs. Basictechnologies applied in the postharvest production of food for man.Planning and development of industries for the processing of foodproducts. General descriptions of food processing industries. Equipmentand processing techniques of food and drink manufacture. Methods ofpreservation of foodstuffs and processed foods: drying, dehydration,irradiation, etc.</skos:definition>
