    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">EXTREME DROUGHT</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2012-07-03 User Id=mpmorahan Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Extreme Drought - Major crop/pasture losses;  widespread water shortages or restrictions
Palmer Drought Index: -4.0 to -4.9
CPC Soil Moisture Model (Percentiles): 3-5
USGS Weekly Streamflow (Percentiles): 3-5
Standardized Precipitation Index (SPI): -1.6 to -1.9
Objective Short and Long-term Drought Indicator Blends (Percentiles): 3-5
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2012-06-25 User Id=mpmorahan Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
