System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Defined by topographic divides and delineate areas where surface-water runoff drains into a common surface-water body, such as a lake or section of a stream.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2016-03-31 User Id=gee-cee Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=WATERSHED BOUNDARIES [b98123fc-6a87-4396-8e1a-ae7406e76ff6,158759] - WATERSHED CHARACTERISTICS [c84b61fe-720a-4240-b6c8-8dcc9ae24a36,86191]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="http://wa.water.usgs.gov/projects/wria01/wb_intro.htm" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Defined by topographic divides and delineate areas where surface-water runoff drains into a common surface-water body, such as a lake or section of a stream.</skos:definition>
