    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">HUMIDITY INDEX</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Humidity Index is based on a ratio of annual precipitation and
potential evapotranspiration
There are various humidity indices including:
The Global Humidity Index
Evaporative Cooling Humidity Index
Heat-Humidity Index</skos:definition>
