    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any measure related to any substance that is added to food, either directlyor indirectly, to improve nutrition, taste, or shelf life.  Examplesinclude colorants, flavorings, seasonings, emulsifiers, stabilizers,thickeners, sweeteners, preservatives, antioxidants, etc.</skos:definition>
