    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any measure related to the contamination and toxicology of food stuffscaused by improper handeling, improper storage, improper preparation,etc... Food safety; Deleterious food microorganisms; Food toxicology andspoilage: defects, diseases, adulteration, contamination; Residues fromfeed additives such as hormones and antibiotics; Public health aspects offoodstuffs: meat inspection, food hygiene, food disease control, etc.</skos:definition>
