System Note=update Definition
Old Value=The ratio of reflected radiation to that of the  incident radiation on
a surface. The suffix (-ance) implies a property of  that particular
specimen surface.
New Value=The ratio of reflected radiation to that of the incident radiation on a surface.</skos:changeNote>
