    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Adapted from: Herren, R.V., and R.L. Donahue.  1991.  The Agriculture Dictionary, Delmar Publishers INC.  Albany, New york.  553pp." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Measurements related to any Horticultural (flowers and ornimental shrubsand trees, gardens) product which is an  article of commerce .</skos:definition>
