    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Benedict, M. A., &amp; McMahon, E. T. (2006). ​Green infrastructure: Linkinglandscapes and communities​. Washington, D.C.: Island Press." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Green infrastructure is an interconnected network of natural areas andother open spaces that conserves natural ecosystem values andfunctions, sustains clean air and water, and provides a wide array ofbenefits to people and wildlife.</skos:definition>
