New Value=ACCRETION [ee016b0b-353b-4811-bfc2-5d32aed59f29,105555] - COASTAL PROCESSES [e26803a0-82ea-40c4-a41a-9e222c9bd09a,86507]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="PhysicalGeography.net" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The process where coastal sediments return to the visible portion of the beach following storm erosion.</skos:definition>
