    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">RIFT VALLEYS</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Pertaining to the valley that forms down the center of a mid-ocean ridgewhere the formation of oceanic crust occurs.</skos:definition>
